optimistic|Positive expectation is not certainty of completion. Team repair example and about complement checked; Vietnamese explicitly describes hopeful possibility without inventing a result.
soup|Broad liquid-food definition avoids a single ingredient requirement; water or stock is a preparation context. Shared hot bowl translates faithfully; countability explanation allows varieties and restaurant servings.
widely|Distribution across users rather than physical width is intended. Guide use does not claim all volunteers use it; Vietnamese rộng rãi is standalone and passive voice is not an exclusive grammar rule.
culminate|Series reaching a significant endpoint matches rehearsal/performance context. Culminate in is intransitive and the gloss is not limited to negative extremes; location and time progression preserved in Vietnamese.
ethnic|Shared cultural/ancestral affiliation is not conflated with foreignness or automatically a minority. Festival sentence stays neutral; Vietnamese and noun-modifying adjective construction align without taxonomy assignment.
